# ============================================================
# App module .gitignore - Android 12 project
#
# This file ignores the module-level build output generated
# by Gradle when compiling the app. The build directory
# contains compiled classes, dex files, APKs, and R8/ProGuard
# outputs that should NEVER be committed to version control.
#
# The PROJECT-LEVEL .gitignore (at /Android12CameraFix/.gitignore)
# already has a /build pattern that covers this directory too,
# but having a module-level .gitignore is a defensive best
# practice for Android projects.
# ============================================================

# ============================================================
# Gradle build output (compiled classes, dex, APK, AAB)
# ============================================================
/build
